<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh November trade deficit at $129 mln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh November trade deficit at $129 mln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's trade deficit widened to $129 million in November from $82 million in September and narrowed from $149.5 million in November, 1995, central bank officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>BANGLADESH'S BALANCE OF TRADE</p>
<p>(In Million U.S. dollar)</p>
<p>			  November  October  November 95</p>
<p>    Exports	   318.0     315.0    326.97</p>
<p>    Imports	   447.O     397.0    476.47</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
